  "description": "The Titan X Prefilled Pod Kit is a long-lasting, easy-to-use vaping device designed to offer the performance and versatility of a pod system with the convenience of a disposable. Unlike older single-use models, the Titan X is fully rechargeable and refillable through an innovative auto-refill system that delivers e-liquid from internal flavour capsules directly to the 2ml mouthpiece tank. Each Titan X device contains three 5ml flavour refill capsules stored neatly inside the body of the device, alongside a prefilled 2ml tank (mouthpiece). As you vape, the system automatically tops up the tank from these internal capsules, providing up to 10,000 puffs (depending on usage) of consistent, flavour-rich, satisfying vapour with no messy refilling or coil changes required. The Titan X is draw-activated and features a USB-C rechargeable battery, a smart display with puff counter and battery status, and a compact design ideal for everyday MTL (mouth-to-lung) vaping. It arrives ready to use with 20mg nicotine salt e-liquid for smooth, fast-acting satisfaction. The Titan X is available in a wide variety of flavours, each supplied with three flavour-matched 5ml capsules and a prefilled tank to get started. Titan X Prefilled Pod Kit Flavours Blue Raspberry – A tangy-sweet burst of bold berry flavour. Watermelon Ice – Fresh, delicately sweet Watermelon with a clean Menthol exhale. Cool Mint – A crisp and refreshing Mint flavour with a cooling finish. Cherry Fizz – Bright Cherry with a sparkling edge and tangy aftertaste. Strawberry Raspberry Cherry – A bold mixed berry medley with sweet and tart layers. Pink Burst – A confectionery-inspired blend of fruit chews with a juicy finish. Fruit Punch – A vibrant fusion of tropical fruit flavours. Blueberry Sour Razz – Juicy Blueberry with a tangy Raspberry twist. Lemon Lime – A zesty, citrusy blend of Lemon and Lime. Strawberry Kiwi Watermelon – A sun-soaked fruit trio with tropical vibes. Rainbow Burst – A fruity medley inspired by sweet confectionery flavours. Banana Ice – Sweet Banana with a brisk Menthol chill. Triple Berry – A rich, fruity mix of Blackberry, Raspberry and Blueberry. Cola Freeze – Classic fizzy Cola with an icy finish. Sour Apple – A sharp and juicy Green Apple with a tangy edge. Whether you're switching from disposables or looking for a longer-lasting, low-maintenance vape, the Titan X offers flavour-packed performance and excellent value in a sleek, refillable format. The Titan X Prefilled Pod Vape Kit Please Note: This kit does NOT come with a USB-C charging cable Shop Titan X Refill Pods",
